repository-code: "https://github.com/arkwith7/semiconductor-knowledge-base"
abstract: >-
  SDKB is a provenance-grounded curation knowledge base for semiconductor
  technology management. It integrates manufacturing process, equipment,
  material, FMEA, and multi-jurisdiction regulatory layers with patent
  classification, RBV, commercialization, and foresight modules. The
  Semiconductor Industry Rejected Patents (SIRP) dataset adds 773
  examiner-grounded prior-art labels supporting the AFCP-EM platform
  (Agent-First Compliance Platform for Expert/PriorArt Matching).
keywords:
  - semiconductor
  - ontology
  - knowledge-graph
  - patent-analytics
  - prior-art-retrieval
  - expert-matching
  - technology-management
  - FMEA
  - foresight
  - export-control
